Z||000000||FieroLisa||01-10-2001||02:22 PM||||Well today I sold my coupe. The guy who bought her didn't even hear her start, get in, or drive it, and gave me half the cash as money down before seeing the engine or asking if it was a 4 or a 6. He bought it for $2,300 without even trying to barter. WOW. I knew someone like this would come along. Now I just have to fed ex the title to my mom (since she technically owns the car for cheaper insurance) transfer the ownership, and get the remaining cash. I'm soooo excited. I don't think I've ever held a thousand dollars cash in one hand, and was like clutching it all the way to the bank :)<BR>YAY!!! NOw I can buy rims for the GT ;)||||reg||1
